flowchart TB
    A[User question] --> B[Retrieved chunk]
    B --> C[Generated answer]

    B --> D[Grounding review]
    C --> D

    D --> E{Answer uses only evidence?}
    E -->|Yes| F[Grounded answer]
    E -->|No| G[Unsupported claim]

    G --> H[Revise prompt or retrieval]
    H --> I[Search again]
    I --> B

    F --> J[Answer with source]
